  "comment:overrides": "Pin the ENTIRE @wordpress tree to the exact versions @automattic/isolated-block-editor@2.30.0 bundles. Caret ranges otherwise resolve transitive packages to a newer line, producing duplicate registries (@wordpress/data, core-data) and CJS/ESM interop breaks (sync, is-shallow-equal) — a fatal 'reading get of undefined' in BlockEditor. One consistent version set is the only robust fix. (Decision 0003.)",
